{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-plugin-doctor#card-zh","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-plugin-doctor","commit":"14bbb2d5865e63a55aefe492238b5dc046098b97","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-doctor 是面向 DSH 插件开发者的检查工具，可通过 Web、TUI 或 CLI 使用。它以 Cordis bundle 插件形式注册只读 plugin_doctor 工具和 /doctor 命令，也提供 doctor.mjs 命令行入口。检查覆盖包结构与入口、Cordis 契约、宿主服务和版本兼容、生态目录条目，并可选择在隔离环境中进行冒烟检查；报告汇总各项结果及降级状态。适合维护或发布 DSH 插件时核对安装配置与宿主接入情况。使用需 Node.js ^22.19.0 或 >=24.0.0；默认插件检查不需额外 API 密钥，动态冒烟需要网络及 pnpm。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin.mjs:39-80","plugin.mjs:114-165","doctor.mjs:99-105"]}
{"unit_id":"PerryLink__dsh-plugin-doctor#card-en","repo":"PerryLink/dsh-plugin-doctor","commit":"14bbb2d5865e63a55aefe492238b5dc046098b97","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-doctor checks DSH plugins from Web, TUI, or CLI. Its bundle registers a read-only tool and /doctor command; doctor.mjs is also a CLI. It checks package structure, Cordis contracts, host compatibility, and listings, with optional sandbox smoke checks. Requires Node.js ^22.19.0 or >=24.0.0.","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin.mjs:39-80","plugin.mjs:114-165","doctor.mjs:99-105"]}
